    <text><table><thead><tr><th>System</th><th>Result</th><th>Finding</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Constitutional</td><td>Negative</td><td>Energy improving; no weight change of note</td></tr><tr><td>Gastrointestinal</td><td>Negative</td><td>Early nausea resolved; no diarrhea, heartburn, or bleeding</td></tr><tr><td>Genitourinary</td><td>Negative</td><td>No sexual side effects</td></tr><tr><td>Neurological</td><td>Negative</td><td>No headache, tremor, or restlessness</td></tr><tr><td>Psychiatric</td><td>Positive</td><td>Low mood easing but not gone; sleep and concentration better; no suicidal thoughts, elevated mood, or racing thoughts</td></tr></tbody></table><paragraph>5 systems reviewed. [S]</paragraph></text>

  </section>
